   "source": [
    "## Import Data\n",
    "df = pd.read_excel('data/Concrete_Data.xls', engine='xlrd')\n",
    "\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b85633b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Gradient Descent from Scratch  \n",
    "Implement a gradient descent optimization algorithm using MSE as the objective function.  \n",
    "\n",
    "Codebase must support both univariate models (y=mx+b) and multivariate models (input x, vector of length p, p+1 parameters). \n",
    "\n",
    "Evaluate all models using both MSE and variance explained R^2 = 1 - MSE / Variance(observed)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "id": "badaa161",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from gradient_descent import gradient_descent, evaluate"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "498161a4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Data Analysis  \n",
    "\n",
    "Use the implemented algorithm, a third-part linear model optimization tool, and a third-party statistical tool for the following."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 41,
   "id": "81b6bd4f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Index(['Cement (component 1)(kg in a m^3 mixture)',\n",
